      253.55
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE NATIONAL MINIMUM WAGE OF WORKERSACT, NO. 3 OF 2016",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      268.01,
      401.91,
      292.31
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      306.17,
      401.88,
      329.51
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the National MinimumWage of Workers (Amendment) Act, No. of 2021.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      342.17,
      401.94,
      425.51
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 3 of the National Minimum Wage of WorkersAct, No. 3 of 2016 is hereby amended in subsection (1) thereofby the substitution for the words, \u201cshall be ten thousandrupees and the national minimum daily wage of a workershall be four hundred rupees\u201d of the words, \u201cshall be twelvethousand five hundred rupees and the national minimumdaily wage of a worker shall be five hundred rupees.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      438.17,
      401.9,
      461.51
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
